  "body": "Designed to complement today's lifestyle, this beautifully presented residence combines modern style, practical functionality, and low-maintenance living in Orewa. Set on an approximately 192sqm section with an approximately 92sqm floor area, this thoughtfully designed home offers an outstanding opportunity for first-home buyers, young families, or investors seeking quality and long-term value.\r\n \r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area creates a bright and inviting environment where family life naturally comes together. The contemporary kitchen has been carefully designed with quality appliances, sleek cabinetry, generous preparation space, and a highly functional layout, making everyday cooking both enjoyable and efficient.\r\n\r\nExtending effortlessly from the living space, large sliding doors connect to a generous sun-soaked deck. Whether hosting weekend BBQs, enjoying outdoor dining with friends, or simply unwinding in your own peaceful outdoor sanctuary, this space is perfectly suited to every occasion.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom provides a comfortable retreat complete with a stylish ensuite and generous wardrobe, while two additional bedrooms are well-proportioned and serviced by a beautifully finished family bathroom. The family bathroom features dual access from both the hallway and one of the bedrooms, providing the option to transform the space into a convenient ensuite-style for added privacy and functionality.\r\n. Adding further practicality to everyday living, the home also features a dedicated laundry area to enhance convenience and organisation.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n-Central air-conditioning\r\n-Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n-Pre wiring for EV Charger\r\n\r\nLocated within the thriving Strathmill neighbourhood, you'll enjoy the benefits of a modern community surrounded by quality homes, green spaces, and excellent local amenities. With Orewa Beach, cafés, shops, schools, motorway access, and recreational facilities all within easy reach, this location offers the perfect balance of lifestyle and convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a smart investment, or a modern property that's easy to lock up and leave, this impressive residence is ready to welcome its next owners.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing.",
